Noel-chan sang here for her 1 million subscriber milestone, and also for SSV...

267
00:21:16,065 --> 00:21:19,265
そうそうそう！ビーチ！そこのビーチでさ
That's right, right! The beach! On that beach,

268
00:21:19,365 --> 00:21:23,345
3人で歌いたいなってずっと思ってた曲があったの。
there was a song the three of us always wanted to sing together.

269
00:21:23,845 --> 00:21:28,965
なので今日は歌おうかなと思って、ちょっと高いけど大丈夫かな、二人？
So we thought we'd sing it today. It's a bit high-pitched, though—will you two be okay?

270
00:21:29,695 --> 00:21:30,695
大丈夫です！
We'll be fine!

271
00:21:30,825 --> 00:21:32,345
団長も大丈夫です！
The Chanchou will be fine too!

272
00:21:32,795 --> 00:21:35,345
ノエルちゃんは音程の方が心配だね。
Noel-chan, I'm more worried about your pitch.

273
00:21:35,845 --> 00:21:37,845
まあ、そうかね、もうそれはどうしよう。
Well, that's true, nothing we can do about that!

274
00:21:38,195 --> 00:21:43,045
あ、ぽぽぽぽ、足ぽぽぽ、早口だな。
Ah, popopopo, foot popopo, you're talking fast.

275
00:21:43,595 --> 00:21:47,045
じゃあ早速だけど、ちょっと歌おうよ。
Well then, let's get right into it and sing!

276
00:21:47,525 --> 00:21:53,345
真夏の日に一曲聞いてください、「adrenaline!!!」
Please listen to this song on a midsummer day, "adrenaline!!!"

277
00:22:11,645 --> 00:22:14,045
単純な言葉 重ねていく
Simple words are piled up,

278
00:22:14,045 --> 00:22:18,045
もっと心は素直で
making the heart more honest.

279
00:22:18,545 --> 00:22:21,145
なんでもないような その笑顔が
A smile that looks like nothing at all

280
00:22:21,145 --> 00:22:24,845
明日を照らす光に
becomes the light that illuminates tomorrow.

281
00:22:25,245 --> 00:22:28,045
ずっと気づいてたんだって
You said you had noticed it all along,

282
00:22:28,045 --> 00:22:31,845
この手に抱えてたんだって
you said you had been holding it in your hands.

283
00:22:31,945 --> 00:22:34,845
弾けた声に流した答えが
The answer poured out into a bursting voice

284
00:22:34,845 --> 00:22:38,495
今そっときっと願いこめた
is now gently, surely imbued with a wish.

285
00:22:38,845 --> 00:22:42,895
ずっと まわるまわる 夢の中で 繰り返し君と踊った
Always, spinning and spinning in a dream, I danced with you over and over again.

286
00:22:43,095 --> 00:22:45,945
揺れる景色 道は続く
Swaying scenery, the road continues,

287
00:22:45,945 --> 00:22:49,845
通り過ぎる風にふかれて 何度も
blown by the passing wind, time and time again.

288
00:22:50,045 --> 00:22:54,045
越えて行けるから 境界線 雲かき分け手を伸ばした
Because we can cross over the boundary line, I pushed aside the clouds and reached out my hand.

289
00:22:54,045 --> 00:22:57,845
涙は今 浮かぶ空に 預けて 走り出すの
Entrusting my tears to the sky floating right now, I start to run.

290
00:22:57,845 --> 00:23:01,645
並んで見つけた 輝く光を手にと
Holding the shining light we found side by side in our hands.

291
00:23:11,395 --> 00:23:14,345
問題はいつも自分次第 さあ未来を選んで
The problem is always up to yourself, come, choose the future.

292
00:23:14,345 --> 00:23:18,045
こんがらがった糸ほぐしたら 思いのまま進もう
If you untangle the tangled thread, let's go forward just as you feel.

293
00:23:18,495 --> 00:23:21,695
毎日冒険なんだって 奇跡は無限大なんだって
Every adventure is everyday, miracles are infinite.

294
00:23:21,695 --> 00:23:25,045
高鳴る想い 羅針盤のように 今そっときっと導いて
Like a compass for my throbbing feelings, now gently, surely guiding me.

295
00:23:30,695 --> 00:23:34,495
そうだ！めぐるめぐる 波に乗っかっていって 風まかせ君と笑った
That's right! Riding on the spinning, spinning waves, leaving it to the wind, I laughed with you.

296
00:23:34,595 --> 00:23:37,695
予想外は想定内 間違いや失敗も楽しんで
The unexpected is within expectations, enjoying mistakes and failures too.

297
00:23:37,845 --> 00:23:41,245
一歩 踏み出したら 見えた可能性 行き止まりの壁壊して
Possibilities seen once I took a step forward, breaking down the wall of a dead end.

298
00:23:41,245 --> 00:23:44,695
まだ知らない世界 君と一緒なら 怖くないよ
If I'm with you in a world I don't know yet, I'm not scared.

299
00:23:44,695 --> 00:23:47,945
わくわくしている 今が一番大好き
The present moment, when I'm so excited, is my absolute favorite.

300
00:23:48,145 --> 00:23:51,395
ゆっくり 焦らない 自分の歩幅で行こう
Slowly, don't rush, let's go at our own pace.

